flowchart LR
    subgraph API[Abstract worker-facing interfaces]
        Context[Context]
        Call[Call]
        ControlStream[ControlStream]
        Builders[Message builder interfaces]
        MessageViews[CallMessageView / ControlMessageView]
        TypedViews[Typed child view interfaces]
        ArrowViews[DataSchemaView / RecordBatchView]
    end

    subgraph INTERNAL[Internal implementations]
        BuilderImpls[Builder implementations]
        MessageViewImpls[CallMessageViewImpl / ControlMessageViewImpl]
        FlatbufferWrappers[FlatBuffer-backed typed view wrappers]
        ArrowViewImpls[DataSchemaViewImpl / RecordBatchViewImpl]
    end

    subgraph PROTOCOL[Verified protocol representation]
        FrameLease[DecodedFrame\nverified frame and owned bytes]
        FlatbufferObjects[Generated FlatBuffer objects\nFrame, OpenCall, Payloads, Error, and control objects]
    end

    Context --> Call
    Context --> ControlStream
    Call --> Builders
    ControlStream --> Builders
    Call --> MessageViews
    ControlStream --> MessageViews
    Builders -. implemented by .-> BuilderImpls
    MessageViews -. implemented by .-> MessageViewImpls
    TypedViews -. wrapped by .-> FlatbufferWrappers
    ArrowViews -. implemented by .-> ArrowViewImpls
    MessageViewImpls --> FrameLease
    FlatbufferWrappers --> FrameLease
    FrameLease --> FlatbufferObjects
